    "questionType": "math-calculation",
    "questionAsReadFromOriginalImage": "多項式 f(x)=x⁴−3x³+2x²−x+1 除以 (x−1)(x−2) 的餘式為何？",
    "keyConditions": [
      "f(x)=x⁴−3x³+2x²−x+1",
      "除式 g(x)=(x−1)(x−2)"
    ],
    "reasoningFromOriginalImage": "除式 **(x−1)(x−2)** 是二次式，餘式必為**一次或常數式**，令 **R(x)=mx+n**。在 x=1、x=2 時，除式為零，故 **R(1)=f(1)=0**、**R(2)=f(2)=−1**。由 m+n=0、2m+n=−1 求得 m=−1、n=1，餘式 **−x+1**，選 D。",
    "reasoningRecordedBeforeCandidateLookup": true,
    "mathematicalResult": "R(x)=−x+1",
    "officialFinalStatus": "PENDING_DIRECT_OFFICIAL_PDF_AND_CORRECTIONS"
  },
  "teaching": {
